# Marketing Rules

## IMPORTANT: This content is PRIVATE
All marketing/ files live in `_internal/` which is a separate PRIVATE git repo.
Never reference marketing file contents in public repo commits or code.

## Twitter (@SublyFi)
- Follow `_internal/marketing/twitter/VOICE.md` for tone and language
- Follow `_internal/marketing/twitter/CALENDAR.md` for posting schedule
- Log every published tweet in `_internal/marketing/twitter/history/` as `YYYY-MM-DD-short-title.md`
- Log every thread in `_internal/marketing/twitter/threads/` as `YYYY-MM-DD-thread-title.md`
- Keep drafts in `_internal/marketing/twitter/drafts/`

## Tweet History Format
```markdown
# YYYY-MM-DD — Short Title

**Tweet:**
> The actual tweet text here

**Link:** https://twitter.com/SublyFi/status/...

**Metrics** (update after 48h):
- Impressions:
- Engagements:
- Likes:
- Retweets:
- Replies:
```

## Telegram
- Announcements only in the announcements channel
- Log in `_internal/marketing/telegram/history/`

## Brand
- Always reference `_internal/marketing/brand/GUIDELINES.md`
- Logos in `_internal/marketing/brand/logos/`
- Colors in `_internal/marketing/brand/colors.md`

## Content Principles
- Builder-focused, not hype
- Credit the upstream `solana-program/subscriptions` and Cantina audit
- Never shill the token
- Numbers over adjectives
- Show, don't tell (screenshots, demos, code snippets)
